<urn:usf:requirement:cli-qualification-refuses-incomplete-execution> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Absent or insecure session material, absent executable, unsupported transport or option, absent selected model, refused invocation, timeout, empty or missing text and malformed output create no qualifying observation for that case. A returned answer with null actualModel remains an honest stored observation but is unqualified and earns no task-class role, even when the route was selected, the fixture session was authenticated and the fixture process exited successfully. The mode2 command-path test must prove that negative and the exact-model positive. A partial set remains in the full case denominator and under the current all-dimension threshold earns no role. No failure text is graded as an answer and no caller can inject an unobserved answer." <urn:usf:graph:provider-cli-qualification> .
<urn:usf:requirement:cli-qualification-refuses-incomplete-execution> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:provider-cli-qualification> .
