<urn:usf:requirement:cli-qualification-route-is-exact> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Resolve a CLI candidate from the same graph-derived route universe and economics authorization as dispatch. Require one admitted local capability, the exact provider, transport and one non-null graph-selected requested model. Require the returned actual model to be non-null and exactly equal to that requested model before any model-specific task-class role can be derived. Authentication, catalogue features, route selection, login, availability, exit status or a successful reply alone grant no qualification, and an API or paid fallback not already authorized is refused." <urn:usf:graph:provider-cli-qualification> .
